{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfac <strong>Clip Maker \u2013 The Ultimate Creative Tool</strong> \ud83c\udfad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clip Maker is a <strong>sandbox video and animation creation tool</strong> that lets anyone make videos, visual novels, comics, machinima, VR movies, and more \u2014 without pro skills required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build scenes, control characters, add effects, and export in <strong>4K, 8K, VR, GIF, or MP4</strong>. Whether you want an anime music video, a machinima short, or a visual novel cutscene, Clip Maker gives you the tools to bring your ideas to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create <strong>videos, animations, comics, wallpapers, VR movies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export in MP4, ProRes, GIF, PNG, transparent video &amp; more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timeline editor</strong> with camera, lighting, VFX &amp; audio control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character customization</strong>: animations, poses, clothing, makeup, emotions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 starter characters + thousands of poses, props, prefabs, and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FREE DLC with thousands of extra animations &amp; assets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Import &amp; Integration</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works with VRoid, MMD, DAZ3D, FBX, Poser, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import images, audio, and videos into your projects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stream directly to YouTube, Twitch, or Facebook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Webcam &amp; microphone integration for recording</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Creative Freedom</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No limits on scenes, characters, or props</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Green screen, chroma key, video converters included</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build everything from memes and GIFs to serious animation projects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for machinima creators, VTubers, visual novel devs, or just for fun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Why Clip Maker?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to use interface with tutorials in multiple languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full ownership: everything you create is 100% yours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless creative possibilities \u2014 from simple GIFs to cinematic VR projects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clip Maker isn\u2019t just a tool.<br>It\u2019s your <strong>creative playground</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go make something amazing \u2014 or ridiculous. Both work.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Recorded one clip","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1536420/b6b9c12fdef98cf8b190e9c7ee2226cc078e101e.jpg"},{"name":"Recorded 10 clips","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1536420/a15b1c1b695bc72c71da01f159612f1fa6ba9d02.jpg"},{"name":"Recorded 50 clips","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1536420/1cd0748c1bec4377694eb43dec9c38656ec88b0e.jpg"},{"name":"Recorded 100 clips","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1536420/5c828119b97273a04310f9e727a09080ab3c7210.jpg"},{"name":"Created one art","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1536420/2956a7cd20c02202f05033a04f2892aa37f5d3c0.jpg"},{"name":"Created 10 arts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1536420/eca76e5126679dc324baadf10adbde2899cf1eb2.jpg"},{"name":"Created 50 